    </NormalBlock>
    <NormalBlock title="Bringing Fashion and People Together">
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">In September 2025, my friend and I organised Southampton's first Fashion & Wine Tasting Workshop,
            followed by a second event in November. Both workshops brought together fashion, creativity, shared experiences and,
            of course, wine tasting.</p>
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">For each workshop, I prepared outfit inspiration representing four different styles. Participants
            then worked in teams to create their own outfits using clothing and accessories I had carefully selected for them.
            It was wonderful to see everyone sharing ideas, experimenting with different combinations and enjoying the creative
            process before moving on to the wine tasting hosted by my friend.</p>
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">These experiences taught me so much and strengthened my desire to organise similar events in
            Glasgow, creating welcoming spaces where women can connect, explore their creativity and learn from one another
            through fashion.</p>
