    <NormalBlock title="My Philosophy">
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">My experiences have taught me the importance of openness, empathy and curiosity when it comes
            to people and personal style. I believe there is no single right way to dress, just as there is no single way we
            should be. Our differences are what make us truly interesting.</p>
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6 font-weight-bold">My mission is to inspire women to embrace their individuality, explore the
            world of colour and personal style, and discover the confidence to express who they truly are.</p>
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">Because self-discovery starts within, but sometimes a little colour, a new outfit or a
            different perspective can help us see ourselves in a whole new light.</p>
    </NormalBlock>
</Base>
